===Noun===
{{en-noun|s}}

# The name of the letter D. Found in compounds such as ''[[deejay]].''
# Something shaped like the letter C, such as a ''[[dee lock]].''
#: ''the pommel is furnished with '''dees'''.''
# {{colloquial}} Police '''de'''tective.
#: ''the '''dees''' are about.''

